1
00:00:00,194 --> 00:00:01,694
(Penny:)No.

2
00:00:05,199 --> 00:00:07,119
(Sheldon:)You didn't really type.

3
00:00:07,952 --> 00:00:10,452
(Assistant:)I didn't really have to.

4
00:00:10,621 --> 00:00:12,541
(Assistant:)So how about construction?

5
00:00:12,707 --> 00:00:14,627
(Sheldon:)Oh, that would be good.

6
00:00:14,792 --> 00:00:18,382
Yeah, sawing, hammering,
eating out of a lunch pail...

7
00:00:18,546 --> 00:00:22,426
(Sheldon:)...as my working-class fellows and I
sit perched precariously on a girder...

8
00:00:22,592 --> 00:00:24,342
(Sheldon:)...high above the metropolis.

9
00:00:25,636 --> 00:00:30,846
(Assistant:)No, no. This is putting up sheetrock
at a housing project in Rosemead.

10
00:00:31,476 --> 00:00:32,806
(Sheldon:)-I could do that.
-Good.

11
00:00:32,977 --> 00:00:34,307
(Sheldon:)-One question.
-Yes?

12
00:00:34,479 --> 00:00:36,359
(Sheldon:)What's sheetrock?

13
00:00:37,064 --> 00:00:38,944
(Assistant:)Moving on.

14
00:00:39,484 --> 00:00:42,324
(Assistant:)How about doing deliveries
for a florist?

15
00:00:42,487 --> 00:00:43,987
(Sheldon:)That seems acceptable.

16
00:00:44,155 --> 00:00:46,945
(Assistant:)-Do you have your own car?
-I don't drive.

17
00:00:47,492 --> 00:00:49,122
(Assistant:)Of course you don't.

18
00:00:50,495 --> 00:00:53,335
(Employment Office Assistant:)Mr. Cooper,
let me just ask you a question.

19
00:00:53,498 --> 00:00:54,998
(Assistant:)What was your last job?

20
00:00:55,166 --> 00:00:59,026
(Sheldon:)Senior theoretical particle physicist
at CalTech, focusing on M Theory.

